    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_batched_ack_tracker" kindref="compound">BatchedAckTracker</ref></para>
<para>Accumulates acknowledgment sequence numbers from followers and flushes them in a single batch message to reduce network round-trips.</para>
<para>Usage (on the follower side): tracker.recordApplied(entry.sequence_number); // Background flush thread calls flush() periodically or on batch fill.</para>
<para>The leader side dequeues batched ACK payloads via <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_batched_ack_tracker_1a90f3dc202a1e13f6ffb94f796f51741a" kindref="member">dequeuePendingAcks()</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
